\v 6 Then¦50481 Mosheh¦50482 told Aharon¦50485 and his¦50489 sons¦50489 Eleazar¦50486 and Itamar¦50487, “Don't¦50491 \add ≈leave your hair\add* loose, and don't¦50491 tear¦50498 your clothes¦50495, so that you won't die¦50500 and \add ≡so that\add* \add @Yahweh\add* won't be¦50505 angry at the entire¦50502 community. But¦50481 \add ≈meanwhile\add*, all the \add ≈Israelis¦50509\add* must¦50500 \add ≈mourn¦50511\add* because Yahweh \add ≈was angry enough to burn\add* \add those two\add*.
