\p
\v 8 Then Yahweh¦50539 told Aharon¦50542,
\v 9 “\add Neither\add* you or your¦50553 sons¦50553 should drink wine or strong¦50546 drink when¦50555 you're \add going to\add* go¦50555 into¦50556 the¦50558 \add ≈sacred¦50558\add* tent¦50558 so that you won't¦50547 die¦50561. This regulation¦50562 is permanent¦50563 \add ≈and¦50560 for future\add* generations¦50564.
