\p
\v 1 Then Yahweh¦50788 told Mosheh¦50791 and¦50792 Aharon¦50794:
\p
\v 2 Tell¦50802 the \add ≈Israelis¦50801\add* that \add ≈the following\add* creatures¦50805 on the earth¦50814 are the ones that you all can eat¦50807:
\v 3 ⇔You all can eat¦50827 any animal¦50825 that has hooves¦50822 \add ≈which are completely split in¦50818 two¦50818\add* and¦50820 that \add also\add* \add ≈chew\add* the cud¦50824.
\v 4 However you mustn't eat¦50834 those \add ≈without \+em both¦50837\+em* traits\add*, for example camels¦50841 \add ≈chew\add* the cud \add ≈but¦50837\add* don't¦50833 have divided¦50837 hooves¦50838, \add so\add* they are ‘unclean¦50850’ for you.
\v 5 The¦50856 rock¦50856 badger¦50856 \add ≈likewise\add*, because¦50857 although it \add ≈chews\add* the cud¦50860, it \add too\add* doesn't have divided¦50864 hooves¦50862,
