\v 5 The 14th of the first¦57921 month¦57920 \add (Nisan = March/April) each year\add* \add ≈at twilight\add* is the \add start of the celebration to honour\add* Yahweh¦57928 with the ‘passover¦57927’.\x + \xo 23:5: \xt Exo 12:1-13; Deu 16:1-2.\x*
