\v 11 and¦58013 he¦58013 will¦58013 wave¦58013 the sheaf¦58016 \add ≈in¦58017 front¦58017\add* of¦58017 Yahweh¦58018 \add ≈to¦58017 be accepted¦58019 for¦58019 you\add*. That must¦58013 be done the day after the rest day.
