\v 14 You all may not¦58058 eat¦58059 any bread¦58055, or roasted¦58056 or fresh grain¦58056, on that day¦58063, until \add after\add* you've taken the offering to¦58073 your god¦58070. That is a \add ≈rule that will continue throughout\add* your generations¦58073 \add ≈no matter where\add* you live.
