\v 18 Along with the bread¦58123, you all must¦58120 present¦58120 seven¦58124 \add ≈year-old\add* male¦58125 lambs¦58125 \add ≈without¦58126 defects¦58126\add*, one \add ≈young¦58130\add* bull¦58129, and two¦58135 rams¦58134. They¦58136 will¦58136 be¦58136 a burnt¦58137 offering¦58137 to¦58138 Yahweh, with their¦58139 \add associated\add* grain¦58139 and drink¦58140 offerings¦58140—a gift with a pleasing¦58144 aroma¦58142 for¦58145 Yahweh.
