\v 40 On that first¦58500 day¦58499, you'll all bring the fruit¦58501 from your trees¦58505, along with palm¦58505 branches, leafy¦58509 branches, and willow branches from \add beside\add* the \add #creeks\add*, and you'll all \add ≈happily celebrate\add* \add ≈in¦58514 front¦58514\add* of your god¦58516 Yahweh¦58515 for seven¦58517 days¦58518.
\v 41 Do that for seven¦58524 days¦58525 each year¦58526 as a festival to \add honour\add* Yahweh¦58523. you all must¦58520 celebrate¦58532 it in the seventh¦58531 month¦58530. That's a permanent¦58528 rule that will¦58532 continue \add ≈throughout\add* the generations¦58529.
