\v 43 so that the \add future\add* generations¦58548 will know¦58547 that I made \add ≈their ancestors\add* live in¦58550 shelters when¦58556 I brought¦58556 them out of¦58558 Egypt¦58559 \add (Heb. Mitsrayim)\add*. I am¦58561 your god¦58562 Yahweh¦58561.
