\v 9 \add ≈Afterwards,\add* it will¦58682 belong¦58682 to¦58683 Aharon¦58683 and his¦58684 sons¦58684, and they¦58685 must¦58682 eat¦58685 it in¦58686 a sacred area because¦58688 it's a \add ≈very\add* sacred part of the gifts for Yahweh¦58694. That's a permanent¦58697 rule.\x + \xo 24:9: \xt Mat 12:4; Mrk 2:26; Luk 6:4.\x*
\s1 Execution for cursing Yahweh
