\p
\v 10 \add ≈Once\add* there was an Israeli woman¦58703 and an Egyptian¦58709 man \add ≈who had\add* a son¦58715 who \add ≈lived among the Israelis¦58711\add*, and he \add ≈got into a fight\add* with an Israeli man.
