\v 19 Anyone¦58839 who \add ≈injures\add* a fellow¦58844 citizen¦58844, must¦58842 have¦58846 the same done to them—
\v 20 fracture for fracture, eye for eye, tooth for tooth—\add ≈however they injured the other person¦58863, that's what must¦58861 be¦58865 done to them\add*.\x + \xo 24:20: \xt Exo 21:23-25; Deu 19:21; Mat 5:38.\x*
\v 21 Anyone¦58868 who kills \add someone else's\add* animal¦58869 must \add ≈replace\add* it¦58870, \add ≈but¦58868\add* anyone¦58868 who kills \add another\add* person¦58872 must be¦58873 executed¦58873.
\v 22 There's \add only\add* one¦58876 \add set of\add* regulations for¦58878 \add both\add* the foreigner and the native-born¦58880 \add citizen\add* because¦58882 I¦58883 am¦58884 your god¦58885 Yahweh¦58884.\x + \xo 24:22: \xt Num 15:16.\x*
