\p
\v 8 Count¦59014 off seven rest years, so seven times¦59022 seven which is forty-nine¦59030 years,
\v 9 then¦59033 \add after that\add*, sound¦59035 loud¦59035 horn¦59034 blasts¦59035 on the 10th of the seventh¦59037 month \add ≈to announce\add* throughout¦59033 the land¦59046 that it's the day¦59040 for \add ≈making things right with Yahweh\add*.
\v 10 Then¦59048 you all must¦59048 \add ≈declare\add* \add &that\add* fiftieth year \add ≈to be sacred¦59048\add*. It'll be a \add ≈restoration celebration\add* \add year\add* when you announce freedom for all the inhabitants¦59058 of¦59058 the \add ≈country\add*—everyone¦59064 can be free to return to their families, and¦59048 \add all families can be free\add* to return to their \add ≈originally inherited land\add*.
\v 11 That fiftieth year will¦59079 be¦59079 a \add ≈restoration celebration\add* year. You all mustn't \add ≈plant crops\add* and don't¦59081 \add systematically\add* harvest¦59084 the self-sown¦59087 \add ≈crops\add* or the grapes¦59089 from the untrimmed¦59092 vines¦59092,
\v 12 because¦59094 it's¦59096 a \add ≈restoration celebration\add* year. You all must¦59098 \add treat it\add* as sacred¦59097 and \add just\add* eat¦59103 \add ≈what you take\add* \add directly\add* from¦59100 the¦59102 countryside¦59102.
\p
\v 13 In that¦59110 \add ≈restoration celebration\add* year¦59108, you all should return¦59111 to¦59113 your \add ≈inherited land\add*.
\v 14 \add In the other years\add* when¦59117 you buy¦59123 or sell¦59120 from your fellow citizens, you mustn't \add ≈cheat\add* them
\v 15 \add because the value of the land\add* \add ≈will depend\add* on the number of years after¦59136 the \add ≈restoration celebration\add* year, \add i.e.,\add* you¦59138 must¦59138 take into account the number of years of produce¦59144—
\v 16 if there's many years¦59152 \add to go\add*, the price will increase¦59153, and¦59155 \add ≈if the next rest year is close\add*, the price will decrease because¦59160 you're selling¦59164 the number¦59161 of¦59161 crops.
\v 17 \add ≈So¦59167\add* don't¦59167 cheat eat other—you¦59173 must¦59168 \add ≈respect and¦59167 obey\add* your god, because¦59175 I¦59176 am your god Yahweh¦59177.
