\p
\v 18 You all must¦59180 \add ≈follow\add* all my instructions¦59183 and¦59180 \add ≈maintain\add* my \add ≈values\add*—keeping¦59187 them¦59189 \add ≈so that\add* you'll be able to¦59194 live securely¦59194 on¦59191 the¦59193 land¦59193.
\v 19 The land¦59197 will \add ≈yield its¦59198 crops\add* and you'll all \add ≈have plenty to eat¦59199\add*, and you'll be able to live \add *there\add* securely¦59202.
\p
\v 20 \add ≈But¦59205\add* if you all \add ≈wonder\add* what¦59207 you'll eat¦59209 in¦59212 \add &that\add* seventh¦59213 year¦59212 when¦59205 you'll neither \add ≈plant crops\add* or \add ≈do organised harvests\add*,
\v 21 \add ≈well\add* I'll¦59223 \add ≈send\add* my¦59226 blessing¦59226 to¦59227 you all in¦59228 the sixth¦59229 year¦59228, and¦59223 it'll¦59230 produce¦59233 enough for¦59234 three¦59234 years¦59235
\v 22 \add ≈so\add* you all can still eat that \add ≈stored\add* food while you \add ≈plant crops\add* in the eighth¦59240 year \add ≈to feed you all through\add* the ninth¦59249 year.
\s1 Returning property to the clan
