\p
\v 23 The¦59257 land can not¦59258 be¦59259 \add ≈irrevocably\add* sold¦59259, because¦59261 it¦59259 belongs to me¦59263 and you all are¦59267 foreigners and temporary residents¦59268 \add ≈on my\add* \add land\add*.
