\v 27 then he can calculate¦59308 \add ≈the value of the years¦59311\add* \add until the restoration celebration\add*, and¦59308 then \add ≈for that amount\add* he \add ≈must¦59308 be allowed to\add* \add ≈buy the land back from the person¦59317 he'd sold¦59319 it¦59321 to\add*.
