\v 29 If¦59347 a house¦59350 inside a walled city¦59353 is¦59359 sold¦59349, then¦59346 the right¦59356 \add ≈to buy it¦59363 back\add* will¦59363 last until¦59357 one full year¦59360 after the sale¦59361.
