\p
\v 35 If \add ≈a fellow citizen\add* becomes¦59461 poor and \add ≈is unable to survive\add* beside you, then you must¦59461 \add ≈support\add* \add @that person\add* and \add ≈allow him to live¦59470 with¦59471 you like a foreigner might\add*.\x + \xo 25:35: \xt Deu 15:7-8.\x*
