\v 45 or else from¦59599 the children or clans of¦59600 the foreigners who¦59601 are living among you—you all can \add ≈own¦59613 them¦59603\add*
\v 46 and¦59615 then¦59615 pass them on to your children to own¦59621 as their inheritance¦59615. You¦59628 all can make them work¦59624 indefinitely \add for you\add*, but¦59615 you mustn't harshly¦59635 oppress your \add ≈fellow Israelis¦59626\add*.
