\p
\v 1 You all mustn't make¦59780 worthless¦59782 idols¦59782 or carved¦59790 images¦59790 for¦59781 yourselves, or set¦59787 up¦59787 sacred¦59784 pillars¦59784. In¦59793 your country, you must¦59780 never bow¦59794 down¦59794 to¦59781 an¦59783 \add engraved\add* stone¦59789 image¦59790, because¦59796 I¦59797 am¦59798 your god¦59799 Yahweh¦59798.\x + \xo 26:1: a \xt Lev 19:4; \xo b \xt Exo 20:4; Deu 5:8; 16:21-22; 27:1.\x*
