\v 6 Between one month¦60567 old and five years¦60572, it's¦60573 five silver¦60578 coins for a male and three¦60581 for a female¦60579.
\v 7 For sixty¦60588 years¦60589 old and older, it's¦60594 fifteen silver coins for a male¦60593 and ten¦60600 for a female¦60599.
