\v 8 If¦60603 \add @the maker of the vow\add* can't afford the valuation¦60607, then \add @that person\add* must¦60608 stand in¦60609 front¦60609 of the priest \add and give an account\add*, and then the priest \add ≈can set a value that they can afford\add*.
