\v 14 If¦60710 someone¦60709 dedicates their house¦60715 as¦60712 sacred¦60712 to Yahweh¦60717, a priest must¦60712 \add ≈value it according to its quality\add*—the priest's¦60727 \add ≈decision¦60718 will¦60729 be final\add*.
\v 15 \add ≈However,\add* if¦60731 \add ≈that person\add* \add decides to\add* buy back their house¦60737, then an extra twenty¦60739 percent¦60738 must¦60734 be added to the valuation¦60742 and¦60731 then it \add ≈can be theirs again\add*.
