\v 22 If¦60847 someone dedicates to Yahweh¦60857 some land that¦60852 they've bought (i.e., it's not¦60853 part of their clan inheritance),
\v 23 then¦60859 a priest¦60862 must calculate¦60859 the valuation¦60865 until¦60866 the \add next\add* \add ≈restoration celebration year¦60867\add*, and¦60859 it¦60869 must be paid that¦60874 same day¦60873 —becoming sacred¦60875 to¦60876 Yahweh¦60876.
\v 24 In \add ≈that rest\add* year¦60878, the land¦60889 will¦60880 return¦60880 to the original owner who \add ≈has it as part of¦60888 their clan inheritance\add*.
