\v 26 Every¦60922 firstborn¦60905 \add ≈domestic animal\add* (including cows and sheep¦60921) \add automatically\add* belongs¦60908 to Yahweh¦60909, and no person can \add claim to\add* ‘dedicate’ it¦60923.
