\p
\v 28 If someone¦60947 dedicates¦60946 something to Yahweh that they own¦60957 (e.g., a man or an animal, or a field¦60956), they can't¦60958 then sell¦60959 it or buy it \add ?straight\add* back—everything that's dedicated¦60946 \add like that\add* becomes sacred¦60965 to Yahweh.\x + \xo 27:28: \xt Num 18:14.\x*
